    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Type:  Immaculately presented, spacious 3-bedroom semi-detached home on a corner site at the end of a mature cul-de-sac.\r\n\r\nAMOVE is delighted to bring 1 Ardevan Rise, Monasterevin to the market, this super property is well presented and lovingly cared for by its current owners with a lot of thoughtfully planned out features on show. Located on a spacious end site, the driveway to this well presented home has the added benefit of car parking for 3-4 cars. \r\n\r\nFront and rear gardens are beautifully landscaped, and the rear garden is extremely private overlooking the local GAA playing pitch. With a C1 energy rating this house is going to impress all discerning purchases looking for a quality home in a quiet setting.  \r\n\r\nLocated within walking distance primary and secondary schools, train station shops and garage.\r\nThis well-located property is just under a 5-minute drive to the N7/M7 and 10 minute drive to Kildare Town."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: With decorative wood panelling along entrance hall and with a laminate wood floor.\r\nDownstairs Wc: With suite consisting of wc and whb with window off.\r\nKitchen/Dining room:  Beautifully presented kitchen overlooking mature, landscaped private rear gardens. Superb kitchen units and counter- top. Double sink unit including integrated dishwasher along with oven, hob and extractor fan and freezer.  Kitchen incorporates a built-in large storage area concealed to facilitate washing machine and tumble dryer and further storage.  Tiled floor throughout and wood panelling along the wall.  Spacious dining area with sliding patio door onto private gardens that are not overlooked. Double doors lead to the sitting room.\r\nSitting room: With solid wood floor, recessed lighting and an integrated wood burning stove.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR:\r\nLanding: Spacious landing area (overhead access to attic –extra storage in the attic).  Hot-press area with emersion off the landing area.\r\nBedroom 1(rear): generous double sized bedroom with built-in wardrobes with wall panelling\r\nEn-suite (front) with wc, whb and shower area.  Tiled throughout.\r\nBedroom 2(front) : Spacious double bedroom with built-in wardrobes.\r\nBedroom 3 (front):  Single room with room for a desk area.  Built-in wardrobes and shelving area   \r\nMain Bathroom:  With suite consisting of wc, whb and bath (with wood panelling around bath."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tBeautifully presented spacious accommodation with attention to detail on show. \r\n•\tC1 Energy rating. Built in wood burning stove in the living room.\r\n•\tBuilt 2003\r\n•\tManicured grounds front and back\r\n•\tExtremely spacious driveway with landscaping each side.\r\n•\tFully walled in to the front. Double wooden side gates to spacious side access.\r\n•\tDouble glazed windows and front composite door.\r\n•\tPvc panelling under front door canopy with built in light.\r\n•\tBuilt in oven, hob and extractor fan included along with integrated dishwasher.\r\n•\tOil fired central heating, (Thermostat controls upstairs and downstairs).\r\n•\tCurtains, blinds and light fittings included.  Alarm installed (not connected)"
      },
